{"seq":2,"slug":"first-class-modules","title":"一等公民模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/first-class-modules","wordCount":1309,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"一等公民模块\">一等公民模块</h1><p>OCaml 中模块通常只存在于编译期的静态层面——它们不能存储在数据结构中、不能作为普通函数的参数传递、不能在运行时动态选择。一等公民模块（first-class modules）打破这一限制：通过将模块打包为值（pack）和从值中解包为模块（unpack），模块可以参与所有普通值能参与的操作。OCaml 5.5 的模块依赖函数更进一步，让某些场景无需显式打包/解包。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一等公民模块把模块从编译期的静态存在提升为可参与普通值操作的运行时对象，其能力建立在几条核心命题之上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>打包</td>\n<td><code>(module M : S)</code> 把模块变成值</td>\n<td>模块可存入容器、作为参数传递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解包</td>\n<td><code>(val v : S)</code> 把值还原为模块</td>\n<td>可在运行时获得模块并按签名调用其操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型约束</td>\n<td><code>with type t = ...</code> 暴露存在类型</td>\n<td>打包后的模块仍能与外部具体类型交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部抽象类型</td>\n<td><code>(type a)</code> 阻止类型变量逃逸</td>\n<td>一等模块与 GADT 配合的必要配套机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：打包/解包让模块可以「流动」，<code>with type</code> 与局部抽象类型保证这种流动不破坏类型安全。下面依次展开打包与解包、运行时模块选择、异构容器、OCaml 5.5 的模块依赖函数，以及一等模块与函子的选型对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"打包与解包\">打包与解包</h2><p>一等模块通过 <code>(module M : S)</code> 语法打包为值，通过 <code>(val v : S)</code> 解包回模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type SHOW = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val show : t -&gt; string&#10;end&#10;&#10;(* 打包：模块 → 值 *)&#10;let int_show : (module SHOW with type t = int) =&#10;  (module struct&#10;    type t = int&#10;    let show = string_of_int&#10;  end)&#10;&#10;(* 解包：值 → 模块 *)&#10;let show_value (type a) (m : (module SHOW with type t = a)) (x : a) =&#10;  let module M = (val m) in&#10;  M.show x&#10;&#10;let () = print_endline (show_value int_show 42)&#10;(* 输出: &quot;42&quot; *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type SHOW = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val show : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 打包：模块 → 值 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let int_show : (module SHOW with type t = int) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (module struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type t = int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let show = string_of_int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 解包：值 → 模块 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let show_value (type a) (m : (module SHOW with type t = a)) (x : a) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let module M = (val m) in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  M.show x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = print_endline (show_value int_show 42)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 输出: \"42\" *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>with type t = ...</code> 约束至关重要——它将存在类型（existential）暴露给外部，使打包后的模块仍可与特定类型交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运行时模块选择\">运行时模块选择</h2><p>一等模块最直接的应用是根据运行时条件选择不同的实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type BACKEND = sig&#10;  type connection&#10;  val connect : string -&gt; connection&#10;  val query : connection -&gt; string -&gt; string list&#10;  val close : connection -&gt; unit&#10;end&#10;&#10;let select_backend (name : string) : (module BACKEND) =&#10;  match name with&#10;  | &quot;postgres&quot; -&gt; (module Postgres_backend)&#10;  | &quot;sqlite&quot; -&gt; (module Sqlite_backend)&#10;  | &quot;mock&quot; -&gt; (module Mock_backend)&#10;  | _ -&gt; failwith (&quot;Unknown backend: &quot; ^ name)&#10;&#10;let run_query backend_name sql =&#10;  let module B = (val select_backend backend_name) in&#10;  let conn = B.connect &quot;localhost&quot; in&#10;  let results = B.query conn sql in&#10;  B.close conn;&#10;  results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type BACKEND = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type connection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val connect : string -> connection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val query : connection -> string -> string list</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val close : connection -> unit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let select_backend (name : string) : (module BACKEND) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  match name with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | \"postgres\" -> (module Postgres_backend)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | \"sqlite\" -> (module Sqlite_backend)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | \"mock\" -> (module Mock_backend)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | _ -> failwith (\"Unknown backend: \" ^ name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let run_query backend_name sql =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let module B = (val select_backend backend_name) in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let conn = B.connect \"localhost\" in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let results = B.query conn sql in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  B.close conn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  results</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这比函子应用更灵活——函子在编译期确定参数模块，而一等模块允许延迟到运行时决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[配置文件 / 环境变量] --&gt; B{运行时选择}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;postgres&quot;| C[&quot;(module Postgres_backend)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;sqlite&quot;| D[&quot;(module Sqlite_backend)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;mock&quot;| E[&quot;(module Mock_backend)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[解包为 BACKEND]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[统一接口调用]\">flowchart TD\n    A[配置文件 / 环境变量] --&gt; B{运行时选择}\n    B --&gt;|\"postgres\"| C[\"(module Postgres_backend)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"sqlite\"| D[\"(module Sqlite_backend)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"mock\"| E[\"(module Mock_backend)\"]\n    C --&gt; F[解包为 BACKEND]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[统一接口调用]</pre><h2 id=\"异构容器\">异构容器</h2><p>一等模块配合存在类型，可以构建类型安全的异构容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type PRINTABLE = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val value : t&#10;  val to_string : t -&gt; string&#10;end&#10;&#10;type printable = (module PRINTABLE)&#10;&#10;let pack_printable (type a) (to_str : a -&gt; string) (v : a) : printable =&#10;  (module struct&#10;    type t = a&#10;    let value = v&#10;    let to_string = to_str&#10;  end)&#10;&#10;let print_all (items : printable list) =&#10;  List.iter (fun p -&gt;&#10;    let module P = (val p) in&#10;    print_endline (P.to_string P.value)&#10;  ) items&#10;&#10;let () = print_all [&#10;  pack_printable string_of_int 42;&#10;  pack_printable Fun.id &quot;hello&quot;;&#10;  pack_printable string_of_float 3.14;&#10;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type PRINTABLE = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val value : t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val to_string : t -> string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type printable = (module PRINTABLE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let pack_printable (type a) (to_str : a -> string) (v : a) : printable =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (module struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type t = a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let value = v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let to_string = to_str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let print_all (items : printable list) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List.iter (fun p -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let module P = (val p) in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_endline (P.to_string P.value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = print_all [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pack_printable string_of_int 42;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pack_printable Fun.id \"hello\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pack_printable string_of_float 3.14;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>与 GADT 存在类型方案（见 <a href=\"../type-system/gadt-phantom-types\">GADT 与幻影类型</a>）的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>一等模块</th>\n<th>GADT 存在类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>携带操作</td>\n<td>可以打包任意多个操作</td>\n<td>通常只编码类型关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>新操作需改签名</td>\n<td>新构造器需改 GADT 定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>间接调用（类似虚函数表）</td>\n<td>直接分派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型恢复</td>\n<td>需要 <code>with type</code> 约束</td>\n<td>通过模式匹配自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>插件系统、策略模式</td>\n<td>嵌入式 DSL、解释器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ocaml-5-5-模块依赖函数\">OCaml 5.5 模块依赖函数</h2><p>OCaml 5.5（2026 年 6 月）引入了模块依赖函数（module-dependent functions），允许函数的返回类型依赖于模块参数的类型成员：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let pp_map (module M : Map.S) pp_key pp_v ppf set =&#10;  if M.is_empty set then&#10;    Format.fprintf ppf &quot;empty&quot;&#10;  else&#10;    M.iter (fun k v -&gt;&#10;      Format.fprintf ppf &quot;@[%a = %a@]@ &quot; pp_key k pp_v v&#10;    ) set&#10;(* 类型: (module M : Map.S) -&gt; M.key printer -&gt; &#39;a printer -&gt; &#39;a M.t printer *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let pp_map (module M : Map.S) pp_key pp_v ppf set =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if M.is_empty set then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Format.fprintf ppf \"empty\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    M.iter (fun k v -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Format.fprintf ppf \"@[%a = %a@]@ \" pp_key k pp_v v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 类型: (module M : Map.S) -> M.key printer -> 'a printer -> 'a M.t printer *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键区别在于类型中出现了 <code>M.key</code> 和 <code>M.t</code>——返回类型依赖于传入的具体模块。限制是参数必须是静态已知的模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 合法：传入静态已知的模块 *)&#10;module String_map = Map.Make(String)&#10;let () = pp_map (module String_map) pp_str pp_int Format.std_formatter my_map&#10;&#10;(* 不合法：模块不是静态可知的 *)&#10;let dynamic_module () =&#10;  if Random.bool () then (module Map.Make(Int) : Map.S)&#10;  else (module Map.Make(String) : Map.S)&#10;(* let _ = pp_map (dynamic_module ()) ... -- 编译错误 *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 合法：传入静态已知的模块 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module String_map = Map.Make(String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = pp_map (module String_map) pp_str pp_int Format.std_formatter my_map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 不合法：模块不是静态可知的 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let dynamic_module () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if Random.bool () then (module Map.Make(Int) : Map.S)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else (module Map.Make(String) : Map.S)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* let _ = pp_map (dynamic_module ()) ... -- 编译错误 *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这填补了函子（完全静态）和一等模块（完全动态）之间的中间地带——轻量、无需显式打包/解包、但保持类型依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一等模块与-functor-的选择\">一等模块与 Functor 的选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译期确定参数，大量使用</td>\n<td>函子</td>\n<td>零运行时开销，类型完全展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时选择实现</td>\n<td>一等模块</td>\n<td>唯一支持动态分派的方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轻量参数化，OCaml 5.5+</td>\n<td>模块依赖函数</td>\n<td>无需打包/解包的语法负担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异构容器</td>\n<td>一等模块</td>\n<td>每个元素可以是不同实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库的公开 API</td>\n<td>函子</td>\n<td>用户获得具体化的类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部实现细节</td>\n<td>一等模块</td>\n<td>灵活性优先</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实战-插件注册表\">实战：插件注册表</h2><p>结合一等模块与可变数据结构，构建可扩展的插件系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"module type CODEC = sig&#10;  type t&#10;  val name : string&#10;  val encode : t -&gt; bytes&#10;  val decode : bytes -&gt; t&#10;end&#10;&#10;type any_codec = (module CODEC)&#10;&#10;let registry : (string, any_codec) Hashtbl.t = Hashtbl.create 16&#10;&#10;let register (module C : CODEC) =&#10;  Hashtbl.replace registry C.name (module C)&#10;&#10;let find_codec name : any_codec option =&#10;  Hashtbl.find_opt registry name&#10;&#10;(* 注册具体编解码器 *)&#10;module Json_codec = struct&#10;  type t = string&#10;  let name = &quot;json&quot;&#10;  let encode s = Bytes.of_string s&#10;  let decode b = Bytes.to_string b&#10;end&#10;&#10;let () = register (module Json_codec)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>module type CODEC = sig</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val name : string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val encode : t -> bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  val decode : bytes -> t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type any_codec = (module CODEC)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let registry : (string, any_codec) Hashtbl.t = Hashtbl.create 16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let register (module C : CODEC) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Hashtbl.replace registry C.name (module C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let find_codec name : any_codec option =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Hashtbl.find_opt registry name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 注册具体编解码器 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>module Json_codec = struct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type t = string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let name = \"json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let encode s = Bytes.of_string s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let decode b = Bytes.to_string b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let () = register (module Json_codec)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"局部抽象类型与一等模块\">局部抽象类型与一等模块</h2><p>在使用一等模块时，局部抽象类型（locally abstract type）是必不可少的配套机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 没有 (type a) 会导致类型变量逃逸错误 *)&#10;let serialize (type a) (module S : SERIALIZABLE with type t = a) (x : a) =&#10;  S.to_string x&#10;&#10;(* 在 GADT 匹配中组合一等模块 *)&#10;type _ format =&#10;  | Json : string format&#10;  | Binary : bytes format&#10;&#10;let get_encoder : type a. a format -&gt; (module ENCODER with type t = a) = function&#10;  | Json -&gt; (module Json_encoder)&#10;  | Binary -&gt; (module Binary_encoder)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 没有 (type a) 会导致类型变量逃逸错误 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let serialize (type a) (module S : SERIALIZABLE with type t = a) (x : a) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  S.to_string x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 在 GADT 匹配中组合一等模块 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type _ format =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Json : string format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Binary : bytes format</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let get_encoder : type a. a format -> (module ENCODER with type t = a) = function</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Json -> (module Json_encoder)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Binary -> (module Binary_encoder)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>打包与解包打破静态限制</strong>：<code>(module M : S)</code> 让模块成为值，<code>(val v : S)</code> 让值还原为模块，模块因此可以存入容器、作为参数、在运行时选择。</li>\n<li><strong><code>with type</code> 是可用性的关键</strong>：它把存在类型暴露给外部，使打包后的模块仍能与特定类型交互。</li>\n<li><strong>典型应用是策略选择与异构容器</strong>：按运行时条件挑选后端、把不同实现放入同一列表并统一调用。</li>\n<li><strong>局部抽象类型不可省略</strong>：<code>(type a)</code> 阻止类型变量逃逸，是一等模块与 GADT 配合的必备机制。</li>\n<li><strong>模块依赖函数填补中间地带</strong>：OCaml 5.5 引入的它介于「函子完全静态」与「一等模块完全动态」之间，无需显式打包/解包却保持类型依赖，限制是参数模块必须静态已知。</li>\n<li><strong>选型有清晰分工</strong>：编译期确定参数且大量使用选函子（零开销、类型展开），运行时选择实现或异构容器选一等模块（间接调用换取灵活性）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三套机制——函子、一等模块、模块依赖函数——共同构成 OCaml 在大规模系统中管理复杂性的完整工具箱。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一等公民模块","id":"一等公民模块"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"打包与解包","id":"打包与解包"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时模块选择","id":"运行时模块选择"},{"level":2,"text":"异构容器","id":"异构容器"},{"level":2,"text":"OCaml 5.5 模块依赖函数","id":"ocaml-5-5-模块依赖函数"},{"level":2,"text":"一等模块与 Functor 的选择","id":"一等模块与-functor-的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：插件注册表","id":"实战-插件注册表"},{"level":2,"text":"局部抽象类型与一等模块","id":"局部抽象类型与一等模块"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模块、签名与函子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/modules-signatures-functors"},"next":{"title":"抽象与封装模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/module-system/abstraction-encapsulation"}}